WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.221
Roxy ducked behind a fence.

2
00:00:19.222 --> 00:00:21.442
A moment later she was Rocket Girl!

3
00:00:21.443 --> 00:00:23.817
"Okay," said Roxy.

4
00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:27.649
"It's time to save Metro City from those dinosaurs!"

5
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.585
She blasted into the air.

6
00:00:30.586 --> 00:00:34.372
"Look!" cried Mara. "It's Rocket Girl!"

7
00:00:34.373 --> 00:00:40.745
Terrell stared suspiciously at the flying superhero.

8
00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:47.264
When Roxy arrived in downtown Metro City, dinosaurs were everywhere.

9
00:00:47.265 --> 00:00:52.281
"Oh no! Dinosaurs!" yelled an old man.

10
00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:56.662
"Rocket Girl, do something!" cried a woman with a baby.

11
00:00:56.663 --> 00:00:59.224
Boom! Boom!

12
00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:03.393
Two large dinosaurs with long necks stomped along West Street.

13
00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:06.834
A car tried to race away from them.

14
00:01:06.835 --> 00:01:10.957
It crashed into a store window.

15
00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:13.525
The driver got out and ran.

16
00:01:13.526 --> 00:01:17.756
"Whoa!" said Roxy. "This is bad!"

17
00:01:17.757 --> 00:01:20.130
She heard a familiar voice.

18
00:01:20.131 --> 00:01:23.684
"Rocket Girl!" It was Detective Smith.

19
00:01:23.685 --> 00:01:27.006
He and two other police officers were hiding in an alley.

20
00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:30.133
Roxy ran to them.

21
00:01:30.134 --> 00:01:33.469
"Ahh!" Roxy pretended to be scared.

22
00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:37.684
"It's another dinosaur—dressed as a detective!"

23
00:01:37.685 --> 00:01:40.036
Detective Smith frowned.

24
00:01:40.037 --> 00:01:43.613
"This is no time for jokes, Rocket Girl."

25
00:01:43.614 --> 00:01:46.191
"I know," said Roxy.

26
00:01:46.192 --> 00:01:49.016
"So where did the dinosaurs come from?"

27
00:01:49.017 --> 00:01:52.138
"I have no idea," said the detective.

28
00:01:52.139 --> 00:01:56.490
"Early this morning electricity lit up the sky for a moment.

29
00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:59.376
After that the dinosaurs appeared."

30
00:01:59.377 --> 00:02:04.706
Crash! Several small dinosaurs knocked over a hot dog cart.

31
00:02:04.707 --> 00:02:09.361
"My hot dogs are ruined!" cried the hot dog man.

32
00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:13.081
Grr! One dinosaur growled at the man.

33
00:02:13.082 --> 00:02:17.087
"Aah!" The man screamed and ran away.

34
00:02:17.088 --> 00:02:21.159
The dinosaurs gobbled up all the hot dogs.

35
00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.745
A flying dinosaur swooped down and ate an old woman's hat.

36
00:02:25.746 --> 00:02:28.472
"Gah!" the woman cried.

37
00:02:28.473 --> 00:02:30.997
She waved her cane at the dinosaur.

38
00:02:30.998 --> 00:02:33.883
Just then a large shadow fell over the woman.

39
00:02:33.884 --> 00:02:36.103
It was a T. rex!

40
00:02:36.104 --> 00:02:40.827
The woman stopped waving her cane.

41
00:02:40.828 --> 00:02:44.743
"Rocket Girl! Help me!" she cried.

42
00:02:44.744 --> 00:02:48.340
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the woman.

43
00:02:48.341 --> 00:02:50.669
The dinosaur opened its jaws . . .

44
00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:55.029
Swoosh! Roxy swept up the woman just in time.

45
00:02:55.030 --> 00:03:00.279
Roar! The huge dinosaur stomped on a car.

46
00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.113
"My new car!" cried a man in a suit.

47
00:03:04.114 --> 00:03:07.475
"That car cost a lot of money!"

48
00:03:07.476 --> 00:03:09.738
The T. rex spun around.

49
00:03:09.739 --> 00:03:11.897
It sniffed the air.

50
00:03:11.898 --> 00:03:15.306
Then it ran toward a school bus.

51
00:03:15.307 --> 00:03:18.432
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

52
00:03:18.433 --> 00:03:21.343
She flew as fast as she could.

53
00:03:21.344 --> 00:03:26.163
She picked up the bus and moved it far from the T. rex.

54
00:03:26.164 --> 00:03:34.706
Roar! Finally, the T. rex turned and ran down the street.

55
00:03:34.707 --> 00:03:37.116
"Whew!" said Roxy.

56
00:03:37.117 --> 00:03:41.048
"I'm glad that T. rex is running away."

57
00:03:41.049 --> 00:03:43.131
But then she gulped.

58
00:03:43.132 --> 00:03:47.847
"Oh no! The dinosaur is running down Mountain Street.

59
00:03:47.848 --> 00:03:55.718
That street leads to Metro City Elementary School!"
